{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_913.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"43f88e15c98446bdd99f8b0feaeb431946218e6d57ebc8e5de2ad343e75c5dd5","ja":"今日の撮影楽しかったな～♪　●●●●プロデューサー\nさんも褒めてくれたし……あれ？","zh":"今天的拍摄真开心啊～♪　●●●●制作人\n也夸我了……咦？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_913.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"34410f059020233421c2917542f0ac840688278c6c4f4e9ab38e0963c358b670","ja":"控え室にいるの、恵美さんたちだよね？\n3人でなに話してるんだろ？","zh":"在休息室里的，是惠美她们吧？不知道3个人在聊什么呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_913.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"67aee90833d34c88c3a4f0f8b8ee5d3724ee0ba92484038beb0c75be3c0d04d7","ja":"こそこそしてて怪しい……。もしかして、3人で\nこっそり遊びに行く予定を立ててたり……とか！？","zh":"鬼鬼祟祟的，真可疑……该不会是打算和3个人偷偷出去玩……之类的吧！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_913.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"d1a5f71803d01baffa52ddbabb2dd4b931d9b27bb86d3031aebd7753b2b97bdb","ja":"そろそろ翼が帰ってくる頃だと思うけど、\nふたりとも、準備は大丈夫？","zh":"我想翼差不多该回来了，\n你们两个都准备好了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_913.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"e065115e7d6a2015b71215ffc9e8b01f76d09440f0e74b3a3255059d2ef1b04c","ja":"もちろんなのです！　翼ちゃんが\n戻ってきたところを、姫がビックリさせて……。","zh":"当然啦！翼回来时，公主要吓她一跳……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_913.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"885517ae46e61c3ae363fd555652927df45c6884441d92fdcb2d4eeb2c29ed39","ja":"そこへ、私と恵美が続くのですね。\nさぷらいず演出、胸が高鳴ってまいりました。ふふっ。","zh":"接下来就轮到我和惠美了，对吧。\n惊喜演出让我越来越心潮澎湃了。呵呵。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_913.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"3746006ebeb05e637a05aa4c17e378fd42d20dce6124e62c32bbfc2528815aba","ja":"では、行くのです！","zh":"那就出发吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_913.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"dde19ea535048c020ad4ffe717df9c86be6a1180448ef807c12671050246d903","ja":"もー！　3人でなにやってるんですか～？\n楽しい話なら、私も混ぜて……。","zh":"真是的！你们3个人在干什么呀～？\n如果是在聊开心的事，也让我加入吧……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_913.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"46515cb226d78cbb7cffdaf8bdd9a572001f32ca436dfaac68c49369c231d3fb","ja":"今日の主役がようやく登場したのです！\n翼ちゃん、待ってたのですよ♪","zh":"今天的主角终于登场啦！翼，我一直在等你哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_913.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"3412e7ec2165b27b9be7bd2b78095c37586cc243b4874ab0d6112f1624023420","ja":"……え～！？\nど、どういうことですか～？","zh":"……诶～！？\n这、这是怎么回事～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
